  "title": "Courier Pickup Tracking Log",
  "subtitle": "Courier Pickup: preserves changes and next triggers.",
  "description": "Courier Pickup Tracking Log covers parcel, envelope, service level, pickup window, label, and custody handoff. The courier dispatch coordinator records Courier Pickup events, owners, exceptions, and next triggers. Courier Pickup Tracking Log keeps Courier Pickup exceptions visible until the courier dispatch coordinator handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use Courier Pickup Tracking Log at pickup address, secure collection point, vehicle, and destination route. Document parcel, envelope, service level, pickup window, label, and custody handoff identity before Courier Pickup begins. Compare parcel, envelope, service level, pickup window, label, and custody handoff findings with stated Courier Pickup criteria; route unresolved Courier Pickup issues to courier operations reviewer.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
