      "title": "Current status outcome and next update",
      "guidance": "Keep the Courier Pickup chronology intact through handoff. State the unresolved exception, the owner selected by Courier Dispatch Coordinator, and the next control point.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "key": "compact_exception_evidence",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Status exceptions, overdue actions, and retained evidence",
