            "Pickup authority or secure access unavailable",
            "Service commitment cannot be met",
            "Pickup request and label record",
            "Piece and packaging photograph when needed",
            "Time-and-location custody evidence",
            "Failed-attempt and notification record"
          ],
          "guidance": "Pause Courier Pickup when content, identity, authority, security, or service-level exception remains unresolved. Retain the available Courier Pickup proof and route unresolved parcel, envelope, service level, pickup window, label, and custody handoff scope to courier dispatch coordinator."
